@startuml F6.1-D01-carregar-config-curso
title F6.1-D01 — Carregar configuração do curso
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Coordenador" as Coord
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CourseController" as Ctrl
participant "GetCourseConfigUC" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Coord -> WebApp: /coordenacao/cursos/{id}/configurar
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /coordenacao/cursos/{id}/config
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT config\n+ ownership
Postgres --> UC: dados
UC --> WebApp: 200 + _links.update
WebApp --> Coord: formulário

@enduml
